    "Frames per second": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beelden per seconde"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate checks the configuration before it saves it. Most changes apply after a restart.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate controleert de configuratie voor het opslaan. De meeste wijzigingen gelden na een herstart."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate could not open this stream.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate kon deze stream niet openen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate could not tell yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate wist het nog niet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate did not save it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate heeft het niet bewaard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate did not switch the profile.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate heeft het profiel niet gewisseld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate does not fetch its picture, detect or record.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate haalt geen beeld op, detecteert en neemt niet op."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate found no events of this object to take examples from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate vond geen gebeurtenissen met dit object om voorbeelden uit te halen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate found no recordings of these cameras to take examples from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate vond geen opnames van deze camera's om voorbeelden uit te halen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate has not reported a state for this model yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate heeft voor dit model nog geen staat gemeld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate has to restart before this applies.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate moet herstarten voordat dit werkt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate is connecting to the camera and opening its streams; this takes up to half a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate maakt verbinding met de camera en opent de streams; dit duurt tot een halve minuut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate is picking 24 different examples from past events. This can take a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate kiest 24 verschillende voorbeelden uit eerdere gebeurtenissen. Dit kan even duren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate is training it now; that takes a few minutes. Put more images in its classes as they come in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate traint het nu; dat duurt een paar minuten. Deel nieuwe beelden in zodra ze binnenkomen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate is training the model; this can take a few minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate traint het model; dat kan een paar minuten duren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate keeps the images it classifies here, to put them in the right class.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hier bewaart Frigate de beelden die het herkent, om ze in de juiste klasse te zetten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate keeps the objects it classifies here, to put them in the right class.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hier bewaart Frigate de objecten die het herkent, om ze in de juiste klasse te zetten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frigate listens for sounds such as barking or a smoke alarm (needs audio in the camera's stream).": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frigate luistert naar geluiden zoals blaffen of een rookmelder (de camerastream moet geluid hebben)."
